 Cleanup;folder
 FilesAndDirs.RmDir GetTempPath''
 FilesAndDirs.DeleteFile'Tests/CONTINUE.dws'
 folder←⊃⎕NPARTS GetDefaultErrorFolder                          ⍝ Tests remove "Errors" but not its parent...
 :If ⎕NEXISTS folder
 :AndIf 0=≢⎕NINFO⍠1⊢folder,'*'                                  ⍝ ...which might be in use by an application
     FilesAndDirs.RmDir folder
 :EndIf
